    "According to newspaper accounts, the Lightning, while blazing fast and sleekly designed, had a number of severe design defects, including leaky fuel tanks that exploded, wheels that fell off in turns, and doors that flew open in accidents. Word had rapidly spread throughout Asian markets that the Lightning was a \"death trap,\" and sales had fallen off to almost zero. The Lightning fiasco will result in huge financial losses for ": "根据报纸报道，闪电虽然速度极快且设计流畅，但存在许多严重的设计缺陷，包括泄漏并爆炸的油箱、在转弯时脱落的车轮以及在事故中飞开的车门。消息迅速在亚洲市场传播开来，闪电是一个\"死亡陷阱\"，销售额几乎降至零。闪电惨败将给",
    "2024, one Islamic nation after another has fallen, followed in succession by Libya, Iraq, Egypt, Turkey, Saudi Arabia, Indonesia, Pakistan, and all of the smaller nations of the Muslim world, as well as large parts of Slavic, Hindu, and other non-Islamic nations. The last major obstacle to ISIS in the Islamic world, was Shiite Iran, whose army fought to almost the last man, before Tehran capitulated to the Sunni forces of ISIS.": "2024年，一个又一个伊斯兰国家倒下，依次是利比亚、伊拉克、埃及、土耳其、沙特阿拉伯、印度尼西亚、巴基斯坦以及穆斯林世界所有较小的国家，以及斯拉夫、印度教和其他非伊斯兰国家的大部分地区。ISIS在伊斯兰世界的最后主要障碍是什叶派伊朗，其军队几乎战斗到最后一人，然后德黑兰向ISIS的逊尼派力量投降。",
